  "releaseNotes": "* Updated internal Polyfill version from 9.3.4 to 9.5.0\n* Fixed an issue with Standard Input incorrectly being applied to ``ProcessWrapper`` (CliInvoke's internal Process wrapper class) in ``ProcessInvoker`` (Backported to 2.1.4)\n* Fixed an issue where Cancellation Token is ignored in some circumstances (Fix not yet released for for 2.1.x)\n* Fixed an issue where ``ProcessWrapper`` could attempt to apply a Resource Policy to a Process even if the Process hasn't started successfully. (Fix not yet released for for 2.1.x)",
